# Cursor rules

Read `AGENTS.md` for the agent contract, and `CODING_STANDARDS.md` for the
per-subsystem contracts (bridge, event names, keybind tables, filenames, profile
layout).

This file previously held five rules of its own. Four of them were factually
wrong — `max_workers=5`, a 4.0 s search deadline, `.cache/downloads/`,
`utils/path_utils.py`, and the `track_downloaded` event name — and every
surviving rule already lived in `AGENTS.md`. They were not repaired here: a
duplicated rule is how it went stale in the first place. See the retired-folklore
table in `CODING_STANDARDS.md` before reintroducing any of them.
